msgid ""
"`ros2-stack`, `check-robot-status`, and `record_datasets.py --workspace "
"<project>` take the same directory. Orchestration files beside those "
"scenes (`robot.yaml`, `task_configs/`, `maps/` or `map/`) are on `fa-"
"project-usd` branch `feature/sinopec-test-tube-picking`, which is ahead "
"of that repo’s `main`."
msgstr ""
"`ros2-stack`、`check-robot-status` 和 `record_datasets.py --workspace "
"<project>` 使用同一目录。场景旁边的编排文件（`robot.yaml`、`task_configs/`、`maps/` 或 "
"`map/`）在 `fa-project-usd` 分支 `feature/sinopec-test-tube-picking` "
"上，该分支领先于该仓库的 `main`。"

