#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/4-lerobot_ros2.md:142
#: 3db3cb6047f845478153d1584298f29e
msgid ""
"The uv path also expects system `ffmpeg` (for example `sudo apt install "
"ffmpeg`). `install-plugins` additionally installs `scipy>=1.14` so "
"`--system-site-packages` does not pick up a system SciPy that is "
"incompatible with numpy 2.x."
msgstr ""
"uv 路径还需系统已安装 `ffmpeg`（例如 `sudo apt install ffmpeg`）。`install-plugins` "
"会额外安装 `scipy>=1.14`，避免 `--system-site-packages` 下系统 SciPy 与 numpy 2.x "
"不兼容。"

