#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/4-lerobot_ros2.md:52
#: 875fa5ce89294201967eb05d28339e2f
msgid ""
"Keep orchestration and dexterous grasp in one environment on NumPy 1.x. "
"That matches the OpenCV and `cv_bridge` that come with ROS 2. Recording "
"and policy inference use NumPy 2 because `lerobot` 0.5 does. Put that "
"step in a second environment. If you run `./init.sh install-lerobot` "
"inside the grasp environment, NumPy moves to 2 and head-camera frames "
"through `cv_bridge` no longer match the system build. Dexterous grasp is "
"optional. The reference robot for it is FiveAges W2 with Wuji Hand2. A "
"robot that has no grasp config still uses `all-motion`."
msgstr ""
"编排和灵巧手抓取放在同一个环境里，NumPy 保持 1.x，这样才和 ROS 2 自带的 OpenCV、`cv_bridge` "
"一致。录制和策略推理用 NumPy 2，因为 `lerobot` 0.5 需要它。这一步放到另一个环境。如果在抓取环境里运行 `./init.sh"
" install-lerobot`，NumPy 会升到 2，之后经 `cv_bridge` "
"采的头相机帧就和系统编译版本对不上。灵巧手抓取是可选项。参考机型是第五纪 W2 加 Wuji Hand2。没有这套抓取配置的机器人仍然用 "
"`all-motion`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/4-lerobot_ros2.md:122
#: 293b0fc5819d4db78f0baaa5651cb631
msgid ""
"`motion-generation` runs in any directory that contains `robots/` or a "
"project `robot.yaml`. A [fa-project-usd](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/fa-project-usd) project directory can be that workspace when you can "
"open the repository, `LEROBOT_ROOT` points at this checkout, and "
"`robot.yaml` `extends` a profile under `examples/IsaacSim/robots/`. The "
"public example in that README is:"
msgstr ""
"`motion-generation` 可以在任何包含 `robots/` 或项目 `robot.yaml` 的目录里跑。你能打开 [fa-"
"project-usd](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-project-usd) 时，只要 "
"`LEROBOT_ROOT` 指向这次检出，并且 `robot.yaml` 用 `extends` 指向 "
"`examples/IsaacSim/robots/` 下的一份配置，项目目录就可以当工作区。该 README 里的公开例子是："

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/4-lerobot_ros2.md:132
#: d739495a7d204c599c4f6dad7875cddd
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The public G1D profile "
"[`examples/IsaacSim/robots/Unitree/G1D/robot.yaml`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-"
"sim/lerobot_ros2/blob/main/examples/IsaacSim/robots/Unitree/G1D/robot.yaml)"
" sets `ee_target_frame` to `{arm}_eef` and `ee_command_frame` to "
"`{arm}_tcp`. It has no `ee_tip`. `ros2_stack.motion.required` is `false`,"
" and `args.hardware` is `isaac`, because the scene USD already starts in-"
"process control when you press Play. That YAML value `hardware: isaac` is"
" the composer stack preset. It is not the in-process plugin name "
"`isaac_sim`. If you leave `required: true`, a second controller manager "
"starts."
msgstr ""
"公开的 G1D 配置 "
"[`examples/IsaacSim/robots/Unitree/G1D/robot.yaml`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-"
"sim/lerobot_ros2/blob/main/examples/IsaacSim/robots/Unitree/G1D/robot.yaml)"
" 把 `ee_target_frame` 设为 `{arm}_eef`，把 `ee_command_frame` 设为 "
"`{arm}_tcp`。没有 `ee_tip`。`ros2_stack.motion.required` 是 "
"`false`，`args.hardware` 是 `isaac`，因为场景 USD 在你按 Play 时已经启动了进程内运控。YAML 里的 "
"`hardware: isaac` 是编排器的栈预设，不是进程内插件名 `isaac_sim`。如果留成 `required: "
"true`，会再启动一个控制器管理器。"

